{"4336710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Imperial Command", "steam_appid": 4336710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imperial Command is a turn-based strategy board game where control of territory means everything. Explore a hex-based map, expand your influence, and crush your rivals through calculated aggression and smart planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stake your claim by conquering enemy territory and competing for high-value tiles that provide powerful economic bonuses. Gather resources, build factories, and upgrade your land to fuel a growing army capable of dominating the board. Every decision matters as you balance expansion, defense, and long-term strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo against AI opponents or challenge your friends in competitive matches. Designed with accessibility in mind, Imperial Command features full controller support and is fully playable on Steam Deck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based strategy inspired by classic tabletop board games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hex-based map exploration and territorial conquest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource gathering and factory-based economic upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic competition over high-value bonus tiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against AI or with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck compatible</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imperial Command is a turn-based strategy board game where control of territory means everything. Explore a hex-based map, expand your influence, and crush your rivals through calculated aggression and smart planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stake your claim by conquering enemy territory